reflection for the AC boost, speed boots and a BoH (sokoban had the
amulet). I had considered saving a couple of wishes for a decent
weapon and gauntlets of power, but a bones pile on Dlvl 5 provided me
with Frost Brand and Stormy, and Minetown had GoP randomly generated
on a gnome. I had also found five magic lamps by the time I got to the
Oracle, so I used one to wish up the Eyes of the Overworld to make
mapping a little easier in the end game.

